    "title": "PMD: Gleaming Hearts",
    "description": "A new soul is thrust into the world of Pokemon. Jake is a Riolu who is given a great deal of responsibility only minutes after he first awakens. To stop those with malicious intentions, he must harness a special power given to him by a saintly Diancie. Along his quest, Jake will meet a plethora of friends and foes, all while trying to discover his true purpose in this strange, new world.\nStory by: Fidchell, Aberdeen, ShadyHades, Noelram, and WhiteStripedScarf.\nLineart by: Fidchell / Coloring by: Fidchell, Meep and Bane\nComic will be updated every 3-5 days.\nYou can also see the webcomic on Tumblr! https://gleaminghearts.tumblr.com/\nStarted on Aug 2017 and still going strong!",
